# 20. GITHUB ACTIONS SECURITY

Generated GitHub Actions workflows must follow least privilege.

Prefer:

```yaml
permissions:
  contents: read
```

and grant additional permissions only when required.

Avoid:

```yaml
permissions: write-all
```

unless explicitly justified.

Pin third-party GitHub Actions to stable commit SHAs when practical.

Do not blindly use floating action versions for security-sensitive workflows.

---

