# 28. FAIL-CLOSED JOB DEPENDENCIES

Deployment jobs must depend on all mandatory gates.

Conceptually:

```text
security
   ↓
test
   ↓
build
   ↓
verify
   ↓
deploy
```

If any prerequisite fails:

```text
deploy = NOT RUN
```

---

# 29. CONCURRENCY / RACE PROTECTION

Prevent multiple production deployments from racing.

Use an appropriate GitHub Actions concurrency strategy.

The goal:

```text
one production deployment at a time
```

Do not allow an older deployment to silently overwrite a newer approved deployment.

---

